 <div class="welcome-panel"><div><span class="kicker">2026年10月9日 · 星期五</span><h2>让舞台上的每一刻，<br>成为可寻找的记忆。</h2><p>今天有3项归档待办、2份分享申请，以及1项即将到期的授权。</p><el-button type="primary" @click="emit('navigate','inbox')">处理我的待办 →</el-button><el-button @click="emit('navigate','uploads')">上传演出资料</el-button></div><div class="curtain-art"><div class="curtain left"></div><div class="curtain right"></div><span>春<br>江<br>月</span><small>2026 · 秋季巡演</small></div></div>
 <div class="overview-metrics"><button @click="emit('navigate','productions')"><span>在演剧目</span><strong>12<small>部</small></strong><p>关联38个制作版本</p></button><button @click="emit('navigate','events')"><span>本年度演出</span><strong>86<small>场</small></strong><p>已完成 · 按场次去重</p></button><button @click="emit('navigate','archive')"><span>归档完整率</span><strong>92<small>%</small></strong><p>6场资料待补齐</p></button><button @click="emit('navigate','shares')"><span>生效分享</span><strong>18<small>份</small></strong><p>3份将在7日内到期</p></button></div>
 <div class="dashboard-columns"><section class="surface"><div class="surface-title"><h3>需要你关注</h3><button @click="emit('navigate','inbox')">全部待办 →</button></div><button v-for="(item,i) in [{name:'广州首演缺少结算凭证',meta:'归档检查 · 林档案 · 今日截止',to:'archive'},{name:'巡演高清照片申请外发',meta:'分享审批 · 周宣传 · 10份资料',to:'approvals'},{name:'全场录像授权即将到期',meta:'权利提醒 · 还剩9天',to:'rights'}]" :key="item.name" class="todo-row" @click="emit('navigate',item.to)"><span class="todo-number">0{{i+1}}</span><div><b>{{item.name}}</b><small>{{item.meta}}</small></div><span>↗</span></button></section><section class="surface calendar-panel"><div class="surface-title"><h3>十月演出日历</h3><button @click="emit('navigate','events')">查看场次 →</button></div><div class="calendar-grid"><span v-for="d in calendar" :key="d">{{d}}</span><button v-for="n in 31" :key="n" :class="{today:n===9,event:[8,18,21,25].includes(n)}" @click="emit('navigate','events')">{{n}}</button></div><p>18日 · 秋日艺术季开幕晚会</p></section></div>
