<template v-if="activeTab==='转写校订'"><div v-for="(s,i) in segments" :key="i" class="transcript-line"><button @click="position=Math.max(0,s.start-3)">{{Math.floor(s.start/60)}}:{{s.start%60}} → 播放定位</button><el-select v-model="s.speaker" style="width:130px"><el-option value="说话人1"/><el-option value="说话人2"/><el-option value="人工绑定：许导演"/></el-select><el-input v-model="s.text" type="textarea" :rows="2"/><el-checkbox v-model="s.confirmed">人工确认</el-checkbox><div><el-input-number v-model="s.start" :min="0" :max="2520" size="small"/><span> 至 </span><el-input-number v-model="s.end" :min="0" :max="2520" size="small"/></div></div></template>
<template v-else-if="activeTab==='选段申请'"><h3>单源连续选段</h3><el-form label-position="top"><el-form-item label="起点（秒）"><el-input-number v-model="clipStart"/></el-form-item><el-form-item label="终点（秒）"><el-input-number v-model="clipEnd"/></el-form-item><el-form-item label="用途"><el-input v-model="clipPurpose" type="textarea"/></el-form-item><el-form-item label="输出"><el-select model-value="720p水印代理"><el-option value="720p水印代理"/><el-option value="1080p水印代理"/></el-select></el-form-item></el-form><p>父版本：V2 · 片段{{clipEnd-clipStart}}秒 · 权利未确认不得外发</p><el-button type="primary" @click="clip">提交选段申请</el-button></template>
<template v-else-if="activeTab==='来源关系'"><div class="dependency-card">原片V2 → 片段V1 → 宣传分享SH-008</div><p>源片授权失效后，派生片段与相关分享暂停新访问。单独授权需保留依据并人工审核。</p><el-button @click="emit('navigate','rights')">核对源权利</el-button></template>
<template v-else><h3>{{activeTab==='图片区域'?'区域标注':'时间点备注'}}</h3><p>位置：{{region?'X '+region.x+'% / Y '+region.y+'%':position+'秒'}} · 源版本V2</p><el-input v-model="annotation" type="textarea" :rows="4" placeholder="记录舞台问题、精彩片段或一般说明"/><el-select model-value="项目内可见"><el-option value="项目内可见"/><el-option value="仅本人"/><el-option value="可外发说明（需批准）"/></el-select><el-button type="primary" @click="annotation.trim()?ElMessage.success('已保存独立标注示意，未改写原片'):ElMessage.warning('请填写标注内容')">保存标注</el-button><p>工作批注默认不附在外链中，可回复、解决或撤回。</p><el-button @click="ElMessage.success('演示标注已标记解决')">标记解决</el-button></template>
</div></div></div>
<div v-else-if="page.special==='assistant'" class="chat-layout"><section class="surface chat-history"><h3>档案对话</h3><el-button @click="answer='';question='';answerState=''">＋ 新对话</el-button><button v-for="(m,i) in messages" :key="i" @click="ask(m)">{{m}}</button><p>仅本人可见 · 演示会话</p></section><section class="surface chat-main"><div class="editor-toolbar"><h3>有来源，才有答案</h3><el-select v-model="scope" style="width:280px"><el-option value="春江月 / 2026年 / 已确认资料"/><el-option value="全部已授权档案 / 当前版本"/></el-select></div><el-alert title="本页为固定示例问答，不调用AI服务，也不查询真实档案。" :closable="false"/><div v-if="!answer" class="chat-empty"><span class="chat-mark">藏</span><h2>你想从档案中了解什么？</h2><p>选择范围，再查证据；不会自动联网补充院团事实。</p><button v-for="q in ['广州首演的实际主角及录像版本？','两份记录的时长为什么不同，是否冲突？','是否有未登记的获奖记录？']" :key="q" @click="ask(q)">{{q}} →</button></div><div v-else class="answer-card"><el-tag :type="answerState==='有依据'?'success':'warning'">{{answerState}} · 演示</el-tag><h3>{{question}}</h3><p>{{answer}}</p><div v-if="answerState!=='证据不足'" class="citations"><button @click="sourceOpen=true">[1] 场次快照V2 · 实际阵容</button><button @click="sourceOpen=true">[2] 录像版本记录 · V2 / V3</button></div><small>范围：{{scope}} · 数据截止2026-10-09 · 未读取范围不作推断</small><div class="panel-actions"><el-select v-model="feedback" placeholder="反馈类型" style="width:150px"><el-option v-for="f in ['引用错误','事实错误','结果不相关','权限问题']" :key="f" :value="f"/></el-select><el-button @click="feedback?ElMessage.success('已记录演示反馈'):ElMessage.warning('请选择反馈类型')">提交反馈</el-button></div></div><form class="chat-input" @submit.prevent="ask()"><el-input v-model="question" placeholder="询问已授权档案中的事实…" aria-label="档案问题"/><el-button type="primary" native-type="submit" :loading="answerLoading">查看示例回答</el-button></form></section><el-dialog v-model="sourceOpen" title="引用证据 · 源版本核对" width="min(650px,95vw)"><el-tag>人工确认的演示记录</el-tag><h3>春江月 · 广州首演 · 快照V2</h3><p>演出日期：2026-10-08；实际主角：演员乙；确认人：刘执行。</p><p>来源入口在实际功能阶段将重新检查权限。当前仅展示虚构证据。</p><el-button @click="emit('navigate','events')">查看场次界面</el-button></el-dialog></div>
<div v-else-if="page.special==='similar'" class="surface similar-workspace"><div class="surface-title"><div><h3>谢幕连拍 · 候选组03</h3><span>仅限广州首演 / 不做人脸身份识别</span></div><el-button @click="split=!split;ElMessage.success(split?'已拆分演示候选组':'已恢复候选组示意')">{{split?'恢复分组示意':'拆分错误分组'}}</el-button></div><el-alert title="视觉相似不等于重复；代表图只改变展示，不删除原件或继承权利。" :closable="false"/><div class="similar-grid"><div v-for="i in split?[1]:[1,2,3]" :key="i" class="photo-compare"><div class="stage-photo" :class="'photo-'+i" :style="{backgroundSize:compareZoom+'%'}"><div class="photo-light"></div><span>谢幕光影<br><small>舞台示意素材 {{i}}</small></span></div><div><el-checkbox v-model="selectedPhotos" :value="i">{{i===1?'代表图候选':'保留为独立用途'}}</el-checkbox><p>照片0{{i}}.jpg · {{i===2?'裁剪版':'原始比例'}}</p><p>{{i===2?'3000 × 2000':'6000 × 4000'}} · 2026-10-08 21:40</p><el-tag :type="i===3?'warning':'success'">{{i===3?'已有分享引用':'宣传权利已确认'}}</el-tag></div></div></div><div class="panel-actions"><span>同步放大</span><el-slider v-model="compareZoom" :min="100" :max="180" style="width:220px"/><el-input v-model="photoReason" placeholder="保留原因" style="max-width:300px"/><el-button type="primary" @click="selectedPhotos.length?ElMessage.success('已将所选示意照片加入演示精选集'):ElMessage.warning('请先选择照片')">加入精选集</el-button><el-button @click="emit('navigate','recycle')">查看引用保护与回收</el-button></div></div>
</template>
